{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rYMWg5xyQs1795361302.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>選委會界別分組選舉，行政長官李家超代表特區政府，祝賀所有當選委員。</p><p></p><p>李家超指，選舉充分展現了有擔當、有能力、有作為的愛國者之間良性競爭，彰顯「愛國者治港」原則下良性民主發展，期望所有選委會委員秉持「愛國者治港」原則履職盡責，為「一國兩制」實踐行穩致遠貢獻力量。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.378703+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T15:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T07:05:03.222150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:35.488463+00:00","content_hash":"593a137d12f7f6453d3ca09db72b6e4146c6c6eebea474d6ccba6b19bea4153b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.378703+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}